\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Official: BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Good For  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Budget\b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 2010\par 12:20\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2010, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 17 Sep 2010 06:22 EDT *DJ  Bank Indonesia Official: Rate Hike Counterproductive For Economy\par \par \uc2 17 Sep 2010 06:25 EDT *DJ  Bank Indonesia Official: Will Combine Tools To Curb Inflation\par \par \uc2 17 Sep 2010 06:41 EDT DJ  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Official: BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Good For \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Budget\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Bank of Japan's move to weaken the yen is good for the Indonesian budget, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Hartadi Sarwono said Friday.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank of Japan recently is good for Indonesian budget as we have quite a large amount of yen-denominated debt," Sarwono said without elaborating.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy isn't to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  "at all costs" but only to smooth out volatility.\par \par \uc2 Sarwono added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will combine instruments to curb inflation and not depend solely on adjusting interest rates.\par \par \uc2 "A rate hike will further attract capital inflows and add more liquidity into the market," Sarwono said.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia Governor Darmin Nasution said a rate hike will be counterproductive for the current economy, a further sign that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  prefers to keep the rate unchanged as long as possible.\par \par \uc2 -By I-Made Sentana, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 39831277; andreasismar.sandiwan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 17, 2010 06:41 ET (10:41 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020100917e69h001xj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
