\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW:  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Continue 'Cautious  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 ' - Official\b0\par\par\uc2 473 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 2010\par 07:32\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds comments from Sarwono on inflows, background)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    Andreas Ismar \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue "cautious \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " to smooth exchange rate fluctuations amid recent strengthening of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , its deputy governor said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We still see inflows to stocks and bonds, which help the rupiah's strengthening," Bank Indonesia Deputy Governor Hartadi Sarwono told Dow Jones Newswires.\par \par \uc2 The comments came after the U.S. dollar nearly fell through the psychologically important IDR9,000 mark Wednesday. The dollar was at IDR9,003 late Wednesday, with traders saying they did not detect any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "We were quite surprised yesterday as BI did not enter the market, even when the pair came very close to 9,000. A day before, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed to only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in small amounts. Its moves were not typical," a dealer at a foreign bank said.\par \par \uc2 Dealers suspect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought around $30 million Tuesday to curb the rupiah's appreciation. The amount, however, was marginal compared to the hundreds of millions of dollars Bank Indonesia used to trade in order to minimize large \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The dollar stood at IDR9,007 at 0530 GMT. The rupiah has gained about 4.6% against the dollar so far this year.\par \par \uc2 Inflows Remain Healthy After Hot-Money Curbs\par \par \uc2 "Foreign flows are still entering the country in an orderly fashion, and (it) has started to shift from SBIs (short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificates) to government bonds, as a result of recent policies, specifically the one-month holding period," Sarwono said.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia last month issued a set of policies aimed at curbing hot money flows and smoothing volatility in the rupiah. The changes include requiring a one-month minimum holding period for SBIs and introducing SBIs with longer maturities of nine- and 12-months in addition to the existing one-, three-, and six-month SBIs.\par \par \uc2 Other asset classes in the country have rallied so far this year, with the Jakarta composite index reaching a record high at Wednesday's close and bond yields reaching record lows recently.\par \par \uc2 With improving sentiment toward high-yielding assets, the country's strong economic growth and prospects it will receive an upgrade from rating agencies, foreign flows are likely to continue entering Southeast Asia's biggest economy, analysts said.\par \par \uc2 Still, strong inflows could suddenly reverse, causing instability.\par \par \uc2 Sarwono said that Bank Indonesia will "continue to increase \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to safeguard against reversals" of funds.\par \par \uc2 He added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at $77.6 billion as of July 27, up from $76.3 billion at the end of June.\par \par \uc2 -By Andreas Ismar, Dow Jones Newswires; 62 21 39831277; andreasismar.sandiwan@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (Joko Hariyanto contributed to this article) [ 29-07-10 0532GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100729e67t000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
