\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK: USD/KRW Off Highs On Suspected  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 1,497 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Mai 2010\par 07:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Contact us in Singapore. 65 64154 140; \par MarketTalk@dowjones.com \par  \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0552 GMT [Dow Jones] USD/KRW off 1,277.0 high on another round of suspected USD selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , according to 3-Seoul based traders; but pair still trading higher at 1,259.0 vs 1,214.5 late yesterday in Seoul on concerns over tensions between North, South Korea. "It's a crazy market that (I) haven't seen in a while," says local bank trader. Adds, pair still biased upward despite "the aggressive (dollar) selling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ." Traders decline to provide near term USD/KRW. Pair has traded in wide 1,224-1,277 range so far today. (min-jeong.lee@dowjones.com)\f28 \par \par \uc2 0543 GMT 0000 GMT (Dow Jones) The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2 's decision to decline to offer Swiss franc repos in recent days suggests it is unwilling to accept lower franc money market rates, says \uc2 UBS\uc2 . "We attribute the latest decline in franc interest rates and negative rates on the \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  forward market to the excess liquidity in the local money market rather than anything else," says economist Reto Huenerwadel. "It's a fact, however, that over the last days the monetary conditions in Switzerland continued to loosen," he adds. (neil.maclucas@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 0543 GMT [Dow Jones] USD/CNY NDFs offshore extend gains on USD general strength vs major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ; 1-year USD/CNY NDFs at 6.7560/6